==Variants==
{{Variant
|original = Tackey
|Hackey
|A [[:Category:Red Enemies|Red]] fire-breathing variant of Tackey. He has higher health, greater effective range and deals extreme damage, but has a slower attack rate and a massive blind spot.
|Ackey
|An [[:Category:Aku Enemies|Aku]] variant of Tackey. He has higher damage, slightly higher range, [[multi-hit]] and a [[Shield]] that's much more durable than Ackey himself. Shoots a dodecahedron that causes three blasts, each having a 30% chance to [[Freeze|freeze]] Cats for 2 seconds.
|Ange Lackey
|An [[:Category:Angel Enemies|Angel]]/[[:Category:Sage Enemies|Sage]] variant of Tackey. They have the highest health among Tackey's variants, a 50% chance to knockback cats, guaranteed [[Explosion]]s, and the range to mess with most expensive backliners (600 standing range, 450~750 effective range).
}}

